{"about_the_game":"<strong>Explore Battlefield and collect weapons:</strong><br>You're the only one on the battlefield and no danger looms on the horizon. There are plenty of remnants of weapons around \u2014 swords, shields, helmets\u2026 Take this great chance to your advantage! Observe surroundings, collect weapons, take away armors from the knights, sort and select the best of them. Once you have collected enough weapons, go to the workshop! <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052650/extras/GIF1.gif?t=1739888484\" /><br><br><strong>Restore items:</strong><br>Grab the hammer! It\u2019s time to work on these crooked arms. Heat it al lup a littl and choose the right tool to fix the sword. Your set of reliable tools is waiting for you. Using these tools also provides you with experience that you can use to improve your skills, making your work even more efficient enjoyable. Clean up the mess from the armor and don\u2019t stop tinkering. Your effort can fix a lot. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052650/extras/GIF2.gif?t=1739888484\" /><br><br><strong>Sell your work:</strong><br>All your efforts support your comrades but also help you to make some extra money. Help your village and protect your workshop by using powerful skills that you have. Dive into the world of enhancement and empower people to win the battle!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052650/extras/GIF3.gif?t=1739888484\" /><br><br><strong>Solve puzzles in additional quest:</strong><br>If you get bored with the main missions you can do other tasks based on interesting and addictive mini-games. Open castles, shoot crossbows and much more. Gather experience and expand your skills, which will allow you to immerse yourself even more deeply into the game world.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052650/extras/GIF4.gif?t=1739888484\" /><br><br><strong>Find out what story is hidden in the history of this kingdom:</strong><br>The world is full of mystery and intrigue. Look around carefully, as some residents may need your help. Talk to them to get valuable information or you will be given a special task to perform. Remember that people always pay lavishly for help<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052650/extras/GIF5.gif?t=1739888484\" /><br><br><strong>Discover more cities and battlefields:</strong> <br>The entire kingdom covers huge tracts of land. Some of these are dangerous war zones where scores of knights die every day. On the other hand, there are also huge merchant cities marveling at their amazing architecture. Embark on a journey and reach the remotest corners of the kingdom.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052650/extras/GIF6.gif?t=1739888484\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2052650?t=1739888484","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052650/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1739888484","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052650/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739888484","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052650/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739888484","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<strong>Explore Battlefield and collect weapons:</strong><br>You're the only one on the battlefield and no danger looms on the horizon. There are plenty of remnants of weapons around \u2014 swords, shields, helmets\u2026 Take this great chance to your advantage! Observe surroundings, collect weapons, take away armors from the knights, sort and select the best of them. Once you have collected enough weapons, go to the workshop! <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052650/extras/GIF1.gif?t=1739888484\" /><br><br><strong>Restore items:</strong><br>Grab the hammer! It\u2019s time to work on these crooked arms. Heat it al lup a littl and choose the right tool to fix the sword. Your set of reliable tools is waiting for you. Using these tools also provides you with experience that you can use to improve your skills, making your work even more efficient enjoyable. Clean up the mess from the armor and don\u2019t stop tinkering. Your effort can fix a lot. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052650/extras/GIF2.gif?t=1739888484\" /><br><br><strong>Sell your work:</strong><br>All your efforts support your comrades but also help you to make some extra money. Help your village and protect your workshop by using powerful skills that you have. Dive into the world of enhancement and empower people to win the battle!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052650/extras/GIF3.gif?t=1739888484\" /><br><br><strong>Solve puzzles in additional quest:</strong><br>If you get bored with the main missions you can do other tasks based on interesting and addictive mini-games. Open castles, shoot crossbows and much more. Gather experience and expand your skills, which will allow you to immerse yourself even more deeply into the game world.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052650/extras/GIF4.gif?t=1739888484\" /><br><br><strong>Find out what story is hidden in the history of this kingdom:</strong><br>The world is full of mystery and intrigue. Look around carefully, as some residents may need your help. Talk to them to get valuable information or you will be given a special task to perform. Remember that people always pay lavishly for help<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052650/extras/GIF5.gif?t=1739888484\" /><br><br><strong>Discover more cities and battlefields:</strong> <br>The entire kingdom covers huge tracts of land. Some of these are dangerous war zones where scores of knights die every day. On the other hand, there are also huge merchant cities marveling at their amazing architecture. Embark on a journey and reach the remotest corners of the kingdom.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052650/extras/GIF6.gif?t=1739888484\" />","developers":["Code Horizon"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052650/header.jpg?t=1739888484","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":256913928,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256913928/movie480.mp4?t=1715951622","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256913928/movie_max.mp4?t=1715951622"},"name":"Prologue Promo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256913928/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1715951622","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256913928/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1715951622","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256913928/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1715951622"}},{"highlight":true,"id":256890464,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256890464/movie480.mp4?t=1715951618","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256890464/movie_max.mp4?t=1715951618"},"name":"1","thumbnail":"https://shared.